      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Parameters",
      "contextAfter": "`animatingDifferences`: If `true`, the diffable data source computes the difference between the table view’s current state and the new state in the snapshot, which is an O(n) operation, where n is the number of items in the snapshot. The system animates the differences in the UI between the current state and new state. If `false`, the system sets the table view UI to the new state without any animations, with no additional overhead for computing a diff. Any ongoing row animations are interrupted and the table view’s content immediately reloads.",
